==== ReplaceOnUse ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The parameter specifies the type of item that the player will receive after using the original item.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReplaceOnUse = TinCanEmpty,
</syntaxhighlight>
